/-
  Nock/NockVMROM/Thm54/VclL/Handle/AcceptsJ8L.lean

  **`AcceptsJ8'''` — the atom table at R4b's variant chip `atomChipHQL`
  — and the soundness chain without `hok`.**

  * **`AcceptsJ8'''`** = `AcceptsJ8''` plus `atomChipHQL` accepting (and binding) `qAL` at `chalsAJ8Z` / `M.pubsA`.
    By `AtomChipHQL.atomChipHQL_sat_iff` the variant accepts iff `atomChipHQ` accepts the same columns AND the ruled
    gate `isL·c_out = 0` vanishes at every row; `AcceptsJ8''`'s `atomChipHQ` conjuncts are implied by the new ones
    (`atomHQ_of_L`): `AcceptsJ8'''` is `AcceptsJ8''` with the atom chip replaced by the variant.
  * **`LinkJ8ZU`** / **`hsoundJ8ZU`**: `AcceptsJ8Z.LinkJ8Z` / `hsoundJ8Z` with `hsA : SmallU`, no `hok`, through
    `HokLJ8.acceptsJ8_holdsN_finalL` (`hok` derived there by `hok_of_gatesL`).
  * **`LinkJ8XU`** / **`hsoundJ8XU`**: `AcceptsJ8PP.LinkJ8X''` / `hsoundJ8X''` likewise, at `AcceptsJ8'''`.
-/
